          </div>
          <h1 class="article-hero-title">ATP Atelier vs. Flattered:<br /><em>Which Swedish Heel Brand Is Actually Worth It?</em></h1>
          <div class="article-byline">
            <span class="article-by">Block & Point</span>
            <span class="article-dot">·</span>
            <span class="article-date">June 2025</span>
            <span class="article-dot">·</span>
